    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d796">

                <pb facs="1279" n="1183" xml:id="pg1183"/>

                <head>No. 793.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fish
                        to Mr. Beardsley</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-01-24"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 24,
                        1874</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Bill to authorize acceptance of the judicial reform is before Congress. You will
                    be informed when that body acts.</p>
                <closer><signed>FISH.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
